DS_D06-D10_D08M_1162_en_C_0725__view.inddD06 â€“ D10 | D08 M
Capacity 0.6 t â€“ 1.0 t | Series 1162
Pallet Stackers
Versatile maneuvering talent
 â†’ Compact pedestrian double stacker for transporting goods over short to  
medium distances
 â†’ Versatile use in busy loading areas, in supermarkets or in warehouses
 â†’ Lifting height up to 2 meters and load capacity up to 2000 kilograms
 â†’ Simultaneous handling of two pallets possible
 â†’ Compact mono mast version with optimum visibility, ideal for retail  
applications (D08 M)
 â†’ Innovative 5-point configuration with castor wheels ensures maximum stability
